## 15. Your Privacy Rights

Because Passport Photo Studio Pro does not maintain a remote database of users' photographs or personal information, most privacy-related data remains directly under the user's control on their own computer.

Users can delete their:

* Photographs
* Exported files
* Crop profiles
* Training profiles
* Application settings

from their computer.

